-- title:
--   Original top-cap stopped physical Gaussian source is measurable with integrable positive part
-- statement:
--   For the exact original stopped physical source S_m, at every fixed deterministic mesh, show almost-everywhere strong measurability and integrability of its positive part. No integrability of the negative part is required: the HJB one-sided inequality permits rapidly negative off-strip values. This strictly isolates the source-tail part of gledger52; d41a1f34 already proves integrability of the Gaussian M_m, so elementary max-minus-absolute domination closes the parent.
-- source:
--   Direct necessary child of gledger52 original stopped source positive-difference L1. Gaussian M_m integrability is already authoritative Proved d41a1f34. Potential proof route: one-sided HJB exponential envelope via Proved f85cd232 generator identity, original Brownian exponential moments, nonnegative and nondecreasing D, stopping-measurability of original source.

